  "notes": [
    "Runtime: the gated a8817d01f9 build (patch 0035b) that QED64 has served since 2026-10-03 as wasm64-3ab1c6a9da03bc29; its runtime manifest and every chunk are byte-identical to the served ones.",
    "lean-core and mathlib-essential are the bytes QED64 serves (transport copied, not re-packed), written by the v4.34.0 import's compilers: wasm 8d91aadcda (lean-core) and native 857544b439 (Mathlib, Lean, Std). Re-packing that import reproduces both raw packs byte for byte; only part 000 of each transport differs, in the gzip header's OS byte.",
    "Patch 0034, which a8817d01f9 contains, changed Lean/Environment, Lean/Elab/Import, Lean/Language/Lean and Lean/Shell after the import: those modules' oleans in mathlib-essential predate it. Harmless (the runtime executes its own compiled code for them); lean-lib carries the current oleans.",
    "mathlib-game-extra is re-cut from the import's extra-tree with /profiles/ part URLs: the same raw pack (sha256 7252fb7e...) as QED64's never-served staging copy. lean-lib is new: the a8817d01f9 build's own lib/lean, the tree the release gate passed on."
  ],
